Sexual Stuff.

04:39.000 --> 04:44.000
I'm about shaving a couple more
Podsafe tunes, including a
Christmas tune on the way.

04:44.000 --> 04:50.000
I'm having a Trinity and
biodiesel talk for tomorrow's
show, I guess, along with some
blank

04:50.000 --> 04:52.000
media stuff that I've been
collecting.

04:52.000 --> 04:54.000
I've been using Omni Outliner on
the Mac.

04:54.000 --> 04:56.000
I don't know if you're familiar
with that, but it's an outlining
